- Words are case-insensitive.
- Built-in words: `+`, `-`, `*`, `/`, `dup`, `drop`, `swap`, `over`.
- Definition: `: word-name definition ;` — a definition spans from `:` to `;`. The definition body is a list of words (tokens).
